  "summary_en": "Japan's Foreign Exchange and Foreign Trade Act (1949, revision effective 2026-08-12) regulates cross-border payments, capital transactions, inward direct investment screening, and export/technology transfer controls for security purposes. It contains no AI or robotics provisions.",
